            "review_title": "Review at The Rice Tour",
            "review_text": "Lady S\n1 contribution\n0\nMust try!\nJul 2026 • Friends\nThe food and the scenery was delightful. Such an incredible experience. The tour guide was pleasant, caring and accomodating.\nWritten July 31, 2026\nLúa Đại Việt\nThank you so much for your wonderful review! 🌟\n\nWe are absolutely thrilled to hear that you had such an incredible experience with The Rice Travel Group on our Mekong Delta & Mekong River Daily Tour.\n\nKnowing that you enjoyed the delicious food, breathtaking natural scenery, and felt so well cared for by our guide means the world to our team. Providing memorable journeys—from our 7:30 AM convenient doorstep pickup around Bui Vien to exploring the century-old Vinh Trang Pagoda, gliding on traditional sampans (xuồng 3 lá), and safely returning to Saigon at 5:00 PM—is always our top priority.\n\nIt was a true pleasure hosting you! We hope to welcome you back to The Rice Hotel or one of our restaurants along Bui Vien Walking Street on your next visit to Vietnam.\n\nWishing you safe and happy travels ahead! ❤️\n\nWarm regards,\n\nMr.Ho - The Rice Travel Group Team\nRead more\nWritten August 2, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
